  triage:title "Silent executor failures in reconcile worker — no tracing event at worker level" ;
  triage:description "reconcile_runtime.rs:471 — when executor returns Err, ReconcileOutcome::Failure is stored without any tracing::warn! at the worker. Background degradation with no active waiter is invisible to operators. Fix: emit tracing::warn! at the failure storage site with team, agent, and error fields." ;
